530	 * (encoded run, dotted continuation, each at most MAX_EXTENSION, so the work is linear in the text). Only an extension
531	 * that becomes a value is charged to the budget of one classifyText call, and it is kept only while the budget lasts,
532	 * so the values to replace stay within a constant factor of the text however it is crafted, and rejected runs (a blob
533	 * of `sk-%2F` look-alikes) cannot starve a real key later in the text. A spent budget never removes an original match.
